GEMINI.md
# Enforced by scripts/check-attribution.sh and the `attribution` CI job.

# --- Vault leakage guard ----------------------------------------------------
# This repo lives inside an Obsidian vault directory tree. Nothing belonging to
# the vault may ever be committed. See the absolute rule in CONTRIBUTING.md.
.obsidian/
.trash/
*.canvas

# --- Coursework, not project material ---------------------------------------
# The internship journal and its supporting documents are the author's own
# coursework, submitted to the academic supervisor. They are not Kea Energy
# project files, so under the rule in CONTRIBUTING.md they do not belong here.
data/journal/

# --- Raw source extracts -----------------------------------------------------
# data/raw/ holds source data as received. The LCL smart-meter dataset alone is
# about 1 GB zipped, and the rule in data/README.md is that raw extracts are
# never edited by hand -- so they are fetched, not committed. The fetch script
# records provenance and a checksum alongside them.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
# Derived from raw/lcl by cohort.py; ~1 MB, rebuilt in a minute.
data/pipeline/scripts/gen_source/coverage.json

# Rootless local Postgres cluster (infra/pg-local.sh) — never commit a data directory.
.pg-local/

# A virtualenv, however it is spelled. `.venv/` above matches a DIRECTORY only, so it
# did not cover `services/api/.venv` when that was committed as a SYMLINK to a build
# cache outside the repo — the ignore looked present and did nothing, and a `git add -A`
# happily re-added the entry after it was removed. No trailing slash here on purpose.
.venv

# --- Local runtime output — never commit -------------------------------------
# Caught by scripts/hooks/pre-push, which is how these were noticed: `git add -A`
# swept them into a branch. Both carry things that must not be in the record — the
# Ollama log embeds absolute paths from the developer's machine (this repo lives inside
# an Obsidian vault tree), and the alert outbox is generated .eml files addressed to
# real people.
.ollama.log
services/api/var/

# --- Local reference assets — never commit -----------------------------------
# Store image references here and refer to them by relative path when asking me to
# inspect them. This keeps them local-only and out of the git history.
reference/
!reference/README.md
